Now add mobile styles for the new sections inside existing media query (before closing). And then the section markup before `</main>`, plus reveal JS before `</body>`.

Mobile additions (inside @media (max-width: 968px)):
```css
      .content-section { padding: 55px 25px 0 25px; }
      .content-section h2 { font-size: 1.6rem; }
      .quote-band { padding: 60px 25px 0 25px; }
      blockquote.big-quote { font-size: 1.25rem; }
      .specs-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
      .vibes-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .series-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .author-bio { flex-direction: column; align-items: center; text-align: center; padding: 30px 25px; }
      .newsletter-band { padding: 60px 25px; }
      .newsletter-band h2 { font-size: 1.6rem; }
```

The media query in FR ends with:
```
      .features-section {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 20px;
        padding: 0 25px;
        margin-top: 40px;
      }
    }
  </style>
```
I'll insert before the final `}`. Use oldString:
```
      .features-section {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 20px;
        padding: 0 25px;
        margin-top: 40px;
      }
    }
```
→ append new rules before closing `}`.

